  "description": "Operating Area: Naples, Salerno, Italy\n\nThe Azimut S7 \"ALE II\" redefines the modern sport yacht, delivering an impeccably smooth ride with ultra-low fuel consumption and an unrivaled sense of serenity at sea.\n\nThe main deck seamlessly blends indoor and outdoor spaces. Guests can transition effortlessly between the airy lounge and open decks, immersing themselves in the beauty of their surroundings. Expansive side windows flood the salon with natural light, accentuating her sophisticated ambiance.\n\nAccommodating 6 guests across 3 cabins, including a master suite, a double cabin, and a twin cabin, each space is designed for comfort and exclusivity. The owner’s suite boasts a dedicated dressing area and an ensuite bathroom.\n\nThe sport-fly elevates onboard living, offering a perfect retreat for al fresco dining and relaxation. Designed with both elegance and functionality in mind, she also features a spacious bar.\n\nA professional crew of 3 is on hand to provide exceptional service throughout your journey. Step aboard the Azimut S7 \"ALE II\" and experience the Mediterranean in style.",
